  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "Rule-based: judgement is assigned deterministically by the MACH scorer from harvested signals (stars, maintenance, licence). A genuinely open (MIT) and widely-starred (~3.1k) medical/bio agent-skill library — the largest of its kind — with real clinical coverage (decision support, FHIR, HIPAA) alongside bioinformatics. Clinical decision-support skills are EU AI Act high-risk-candidate territory and are not described as validated; this is agent tooling requiring a user-supplied LLM, not a cleared device. Useful as draft procedures that require qualified review.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-11-11",
  "schema:comment": "No LICENSE file in repo (README shows an MIT badge only) — licence unverified. Built on OpenClaw/NanoClaw. 869 skills, ~119 clinical. Judgement auto-scored by harvester. Clinical skills unvalidated, high-risk. Governance (FreedomIntelligence) affiliation not confirmed. Re-verify on next review.",
